RMS@MIT-AI 08/03/80 00:23:36
Since it is hard to decide what SAME-CYCLE ought
to mean if given two multi-cycle arguments,
I've restricted it so that all but the first argument
have to be single cycle operations.
Naturally, all uses of SAME-CYCLE already had
at most one multi-cycle argument.
So I rearranged the order of args where necessary.

Also, I took a stab at defining the control PLA
and the connections between it and the control bits
for the various jumping data paths.

